      ],
      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Nonwoven fabric is a fabric-like material made from staple fibre and long fibres bonded together by chemical, mechanical, or heat processes. It has various properties such as strength, durability, absorbency, breathability, and cost-effectiveness. It is used in various industries including medical, geotextile, automotive, filtration, packaging, apparel, and home furnishings. It can be made from polymers, such as polypropylene or viscose rayon, and is often used in disposable products, such as napkins and wipes, but also in more durable products like roofing materials and geotextiles.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "无纺布是一种由短纤维和长纤维通过化学、机械或热处理过程粘合在一起的类似织物的材料。它具有各种性能，如强度、耐用性、吸水性、透气性和成本效益。它在各种行业中都有应用，包括医疗、土工布、汽车、过滤、包装、服装和家居装饰。它可以由聚合物（如聚丙烯或粘胶纤维）制成，常用于一次性产品（如餐巾和湿巾），但也用于更耐用的产品，如屋顶材料和土工布。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
